48989cffb1c9743188d2e38885102d99","bom":false,"legacyPath":"化学反应原理/弱电解质的电离/电离平衡常数和电离度/P02-Q13_二元弱酸滴定与守恒关系.html"},"2026.6.13:P03-Q09":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>低能耗氯碱工业</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.6.13 · 周南联校 · 第9题 · P03-Q09</div><h1>低能耗氯碱工业</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学反应原理/电解池</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：分析通氧阴极、阳离子交换膜及气体生成的电子守恒。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应的应用/氧化还原反应有关计算</span><span class=\"tag\">常见无机物及其应用/卤素及其化合物/氯气的性质及用途</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量H 1  Li 7  C 12  O 16  Fe 56  Br 80  Cs 133  Pb 207</p><p>9. 氯碱工业能耗大，通过如图改进的设计可大幅度降低能耗，下列说法正确的是</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:1e4c34a6268ff788c5d516d5864546b270c26d99e1dcb8d6cadb6d20cc708af6:0;\" style=\"width:275.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>A. 电极A接电源正极，发生还原反应</p><p>B. 电极B发生的反应为<img src=\"chem-asset:d3a7d56bb101c0fdf8837b7dbf4720d63a97fb6945afed4fb77fd4e3d515cc32:1;\" style=\"width:177.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C. 应选用阳离子交换膜，在右室获得浓度较高的NaOH溶液</p><p>D. 相同条件下，理论上电极A产生的气体体积与电极B消耗的气体体积相等</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】C</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【分析】此为低能耗改良氯碱工业，阴极通入<img src=\"chem-asset:68c547d59afced6b91566708f62f57c09cc44a0cd31a6a6937e67a51147ff50f:2;\" style=\"width:22.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，不析出<img src=\"chem-asset:7b78a385074ad3b11e6ac243fad3197ed6618619fb667fba02f2b69dde0da788:3;\" style=\"width:22.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。在阳极A，氯离子被氧化生成氯气（<img src=\"chem-asset:2885dbd0a4cd34f678536301cc26a0030211ccca96687be00d04cbd313c93cfb:4;\" style=\"width:123.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">）；在阴极B，通入的氧气被还原生成氢氧根（<img src=\"chem-asset:f4d138d677ba75d4b256d4b686e9782df00e51988b73072c3f302b7201786363:5;\" style=\"width:167.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">），而非传统工艺中的氢气析出。离子交换膜允许钠离子从阳极室迁移到阴极室，与阴极生成的氢氧根结合形成氢氧化钠溶液，总反应为 <img src=\"chem-asset:e2fd7e0ad768c346f70f36151b4acce931faa457bb7d047d48f7a782740b8f7a:6;\" style=\"width:245.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。</p><p>【详解】A．电极A是阳极，接正极，失电子发生氧化反应，不是还原反应，A错误；</p><p>B．电极B为阴极，反应为<img src=\"chem-asset:5652b150dd3c344bfc3c8d426a3b388d18962ad87db9bde268dec4a9e7bb1bf6:7;\" style=\"width:165.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，不产生<img src=\"chem-asset:7b78a385074ad3b11e6ac243fad3197ed6618619fb667fba02f2b69dde0da788:3;\" style=\"width:22.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，方程式错误，B错误；</p><p>C．<img src=\"chem-asset:0d579c91e6c305c67391618e6fee4c9e9a8ec241757ed355dabec1235eb6a588:8;\" style=\"width:30.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">通过阳离子交换膜移向右室，与阴极生成的<img src=\"chem-asset:5351c8bd1402144145562ba64d52b39c4603f61d721ec47582753555115a3297:9;\" style=\"width:34.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">结合，得到高浓度的<img src=\"chem-asset:fdc5451634ec6dccf9b92bc48499e4060ef02265568642172e043671ada14e21:10;\" style=\"width:48.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液，C正确；</p><p>D．阳极反应：<img src=\"chem-asset:62fb60354672244d67088e4760d2c362ec6424edcc0bc5085b27742e0f32634c:11;\" style=\"width:123.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，阴极反应：<img src=\"chem-asset:5652b150dd3c344bfc3c8d426a3b388d18962ad87db9bde268dec4a9e7bb1bf6:7;\" style=\"width:165.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，电子守恒：<img src=\"chem-asset:40543cf6c3c0e6e44283c758fa5116e60b35e6cc4da74e0c3c8739241c0f24d4:12;\" style=\"width:68.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，同温同压下体积比为<img src=\"chem-asset:a72e8ce7e7fa3d32f242982c81c6bc77c216dddb4fca6a3e482a789c1a9a73d1:13;\" style=\"width:26.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，不相等，D错误；</p><p>故选C。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">本页保存原卷答案与解析。知识点标签和分类依据为本次整理结果；未逐题独立重解或校订原解析。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>精品解析：湖南长沙市周南中学等校2026届高三下学期5月考前适应性训练 化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><p class=\"source-path\">D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.6.13\\精品解析：湖南长沙市周南中学等校2026届高三下学期5月考前适应性训练 化学试题\\精品解析：湖南长沙市周南中学等校2026届高三下学期5月考前适应性训练 化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.6.13/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E5%91%A8%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A6%E7%AD%89%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F5%E6%9C%88%E8%80%83%E5%89%8D%E9%80%82%E5%BA%94%E6%80%A7%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E5%91%A8%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A6%E7%AD%89%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F5%E6%9C%88%E8%80%83%E5%89%8D%E9%80%82%E5%BA%94%E6%80%A7%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原 Word 文件</a></p><p class=\"muted\">原文定位：第9题。共享材料随整题保留，小问标签用于检索。</p></details></main></body></html>","assets":["0d579c91e6c305c67391618e6fee4c9e9a8ec241757ed355dabec1235eb6a588","1e4c34a6268ff788c5d516d5864546b270c26d99e1dcb8d6cadb6d20cc708af6","2885dbd0a4cd34f678536301cc26a0030211ccca96687be00d04cbd313c93cfb","40543cf6c3c0e6e44283c758fa5116e60b35e6cc4da74e0c3c8739241c0f24d4","5351c8bd1402144145562ba64d52b39c4603f61d721ec47582753555115a3297","5652b150dd3c344bfc3c8d426a3b388d18962ad87db9bde268dec4a9e7bb1bf6","62fb60354672244d67088e4760d2c362ec6424edcc0bc5085b27742e0f32634c","68c547d59afced6b91566708f62f57c09cc44a0cd31a6a6937e67a51147ff50f","7b78a385074ad3b11e6ac243fad3197ed6618619fb667fba02f2b69dde0da788","a72e8ce7e7fa3d32f242982c81c6bc77c216dddb4fca6a3e482a789c1a9a73d1","d3a7d56bb101c0fdf8837b7dbf4720d63a97fb6945afed4fb77fd4e3d515cc32","e2fd7e0ad768c346f70f36151b4acce931faa457bb7d047d48f7a782740b8f7a","f4d138d677ba75d4b256d4b686e9782df00e51988b73072c3f302b7201786363","fdc5451634ec6dccf9b92bc48499e4060ef02265568642172e043671ada14e21"],"refs":{"chem-asset:1e4c34a6268ff788c5d516d5864546b270c26d99e1dcb8d6cadb6d20cc708af6:0;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/1e4c34a6268ff788c5d516d5.png?v=2","chem-asset:d3a7d56bb101c0fdf8837b7dbf4720d63a97fb6945afed4fb77fd4e3d515cc32:1;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/e052ba7bdcaf14503e6ad516.png?v=2","chem-asset:68c547d59afced6b91566708f62f57c09cc44a0cd31a6a6937e67a51147ff50f:2;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/f38ffa27cbb3a443306ba823.png?v=2","chem-asset:7b78a385074ad3b11e6ac243fad3197ed6618619fb667fba02f2b69dde0da788:3;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/7434fcbc4fdddd3533406a71.png?v=2","chem-asset:2885dbd0a4cd34f678536301cc26a0030211ccca96687be00d04cbd313c93cfb:4;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/cabc6d044161eafe8f16a3f1.png?v=2","chem-asset:f4d138d677ba75d4b256d4b686e9782df00e51988b73072c3f302b7201786363:5;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/2c43858ef599061fc5d94822.png?v=2","chem-asset:e2fd7e0ad768c346f70f36151b4acce931faa457bb7d047d48f7a782740b8f7a:6;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/d354b97c7666acd0a9855f71.png?v=2","chem-asset:5652b150dd3c344bfc3c8d426a3b388d18962ad87db9bde268dec4a9e7bb1bf6:7;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/5865b32bcaf822c71341245c.png?v=2","chem-asset:0d579c91e6c305c67391618e6fee4c9e9a8ec241757ed355dabec1235eb6a588:8;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/60605d34eeac626d355812bf.png?v=2","chem-asset:5351c8bd1402144145562ba64d52b39c4603f61d721ec47582753555115a3297:9;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/d61763f339551dafc12e437e.png?v=2","chem-asset:fdc5451634ec6dccf9b92bc48499e4060ef02265568642172e043671ada14e21:10;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/7dc6790fd43f4cd023004c63.png?v=2","chem-asset:62fb60354672244d67088e4760d2c362ec6424edcc0bc5085b27742e0f32634c:11;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/63390b98e686346832881717.png?v=2","chem-asset:40543cf6c3c0e6e44283c758fa5116e60b35e6cc4da74e0c3c8739241c0f24d4:12;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/105dcb68a72334da063d0849.png?v=2","chem-asset:a72e8ce7e7fa3d32f242982c81c6bc77c216dddb4fca6a3e482a789c1a9a73d1:13;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/b2db3bcb7c377b5b8f1ec261.png?v=2"},"sourceSha256":"1dd0f408d7c94d2f85f73a7a9d622b2ef463e2838dc07a5eac4e9d804dbab5d9","bom":false,"legacyPath":"化学反应原理/电解池/P03-Q09_低能耗氯碱工业.html"},"2026.6.13:P04-Q11":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>硫酸工业尾气吸收液电解再生</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.6.13 · 实验中学 · 第11题 · P04-Q11</div><h1>硫酸工业尾气吸收液电解再生</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学反应原理/电解池</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：分析电极反应、离子迁移、pH和再生物质计量。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">常见无机物及其应用/氧族元素及其化合物/二氧化硫</span><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应的应用/氧化还原反应有关计算</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/水的电离及溶液的酸碱性/溶液的酸碱性与pH</span><span class=\"tag\">化学与STSE/化学与环境保护</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：H-1  C-12  N-14  O-16  S-32  K-39  Cu-64</p><p>11. 硫酸工业尾气中的SO<sub>2</sub>可用Na<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>3</sub>溶液吸收，并通过电解方法实现吸收液的循环再生。如图所示，下列有关说法中不正确的是</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:6ec134cdd4c2f48b61a47df1c3cff694a85b7caeb0af1a7cb8ad09898264a8d4:0;\" style=\"width:351.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>A. 电解一段时间后，b%&gt;a%</p><p>B. 电解一段时间后，阴极室pH升高</p><p>C. 阳极发生的反应为<img src=\"chem-asset:ad849abd8e772b476ec8d96decbc4c76565d68fca002b60fa96d16011c02778d:1;\" style=\"width:230.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D. 电解一段时间后，两室生成的Na<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>3</sub>与H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>的物质的量不相等</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】C</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【分析】电解池中，阳离子移向阴极、阴离子移向阳极，则装置中Pt(I)为阴极、Pt(Ⅱ)为阳极；如图所示，阳极表面<img src=\"chem-asset:15558af1fdea85bb74779ca3a66b95477c4a3948a85bd78a678d028527c0142e:2;\" style=\"width:36.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:4223fc32da198fedb3d0865c83c471e1a7d7528771561c3fc5686120aea15b20:3;\" style=\"width:43.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">氧化为<img src=\"chem-asset:0999ad038689c9bda00bc459b4e462d7d111adcd9439fd7065a08d6b91952fb2:4;\" style=\"width:36.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，电极反应为<img src=\"chem-asset:7f051ce902d80c86520e354232ece1b8e52c14a77a690e9fac0e4d680ce77947:5;\" style=\"width:207.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:26ed1d4f855d1d0dc72c7b65f0b6ed1afbfd02f1325ca0732b308811752a3399:6;\" style=\"width:216.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">；阴极附近加入Na<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>3</sub>和NaHSO<sub>3</sub>溶液、流出Na<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>3</sub>，因此阴极附近H<sup>+</sup>放电，电极反应为<img src=\"chem-asset:18248db12db497c34b53179fdd6799706d88556353fb1f09c96669b60ee22212:7;\" style=\"width:193.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:6eff14198007b9d79417eb00b8f1f43386af72a99ade01d2e368dd088a5518ae:8;\" style=\"width:117.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">；据此解答。</p><p>【详解】A．据分析，阳极可不断产生硫酸根离子和氢离子，则b%&gt;a%，A正确；</p><p>B．阴极氢离子放电，氢离子浓度减小，pH增大，B正确；</p><p>C．酸性介质中不存在氢氧根，阳极电极反应应为<img src=\"chem-asset:7f051ce902d80c86520e354232ece1b8e52c14a77a690e9fac0e4d680ce77947:5;\" style=\"width:207.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:26ed1d4f855d1d0dc72c7b65f0b6ed1afbfd02f1325ca0732b308811752a3399:6;\" style=\"width:216.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，C错误；</p><p>D．阳极产生1 mol硫酸转移2 mol电子，阴极转移2 mol电子产生2 mol亚硫酸钠，两者物质的量不相等，D正确；</p><p>故选C。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">本页保存原卷答案与解析。知识点标签和分类依据为本次整理结果；未逐题独立重解或校订原解析。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>精品解析：湖南长沙市实验中学2026届高三第九次阶段性测试 化学试卷（解析版）.docx</p><p class=\"source-path\">D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.6.13\\精品解析：湖南长沙市实验中学2026届高三第九次阶段性测试 化学试卷\\精品解析：湖南长沙市实验中学2026届高三第九次阶段性测试 化学试卷（解析版）.docx</p><p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.6.13/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E7%AC%AC%E4%B9%9D%E6%AC%A1%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%80%A7%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E7%AC%AC%E4%B9%9D%E6%AC%A1%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%80%A7%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原 Word 文件</a></p><p class=\"muted\">原文定位：第11题。共享材料随整题保留，小问标签用于检索。</p></details></main></body></html>","assets":["0999ad038689c9bda00bc459b4e462d7d111adcd9439fd7065a08d6b91952fb2","15558af1fdea85bb74779ca3a66b95477c4a3948a85bd78a678d028527c0142e","18248db12db497c34b53179fdd6799706d88556353fb1f09c96669b60ee22212","26ed1d4f855d1d0dc72c7b65f0b6ed1afbfd02f1325ca0732b308811752a3399","4223fc32da198fedb3d0865c83c471e1a7d7528771561c3fc5686120aea15b20","6ec134cdd4c2f48b61a47df1c3cff694a85b7caeb0af1a7cb8ad09898264a8d4","6eff14198007b9d79417eb00b8f1f43386af72a99ade01d2e368dd088a5518ae","7f051ce902d80c86520e354232ece1b8e52c14a77a690e9fac0e4d680ce77947","ad849abd8e772b476ec8d96decbc4c76565d68fca002b60fa96d16011c02778d"],"refs":{"chem-asset:6ec134cdd4c2f48b61a47df1c3cff694a85b7caeb0af1a7cb8ad09898264a8d4:0;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/6ec134cdd4c2f48b61a47df1.png?v=2","chem-asset:ad849abd8e772b476ec8d96decbc4c76565d68fca002b60fa96d16011c02778d:1;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/73dff530d8080933b3daaf13.png?v=2","chem-asset:15558af1fdea85bb74779ca3a66b95477c4a3948a85bd78a678d028527c0142e:2;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/95b1b0dd0065c79095e91e8e.png?v=2","chem-asset:4223fc32da198fedb3d0865c83c471e1a7d7528771561c3fc5686120aea15b20:3;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/698747e2938a2170be8ba3d6.png?v=2","chem-asset:0999ad038689c9bda00bc459b4e462d7d111adcd9439fd7065a08d6b91952fb2:4;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/e1b9ba656bd37d435c79926d.png?v=2","chem-asset:7f051ce902d80c86520e354232ece1b8e52c14a77a690e9fac0e4d680ce77947:5;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/d9690f31620a526de8ff6a02.png?v=2","chem-asset:26ed1d4f855d1d0dc72c7b65f0b6ed1afbfd02f1325ca0732b308811752a3399:6;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/001d9a05b696efc4358367f9.png?v=2","chem-asset:18248db12db497c34b53179fdd6799706d88556353fb1f09c96669b60ee22212:7;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/bdae4c205c487de7a4f58d04.png?v=2","chem-asset:6eff14198007b9d79417eb00b8f1f43386af72a99ade01d2e368dd088a5518ae:8;":"../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/68d70d16d4e6461632bbc139.png?v=2"},"sourceSha256":"24b0fe774faf5165cc20c7e9bdbde94880aa229f10a23e51de6b9df8571e4d88","bom":false,"legacyPath":"化学反应原理/电解池/P04-Q11_硫酸工业尾气吸收液电解再生.html"},"2026.6.13:P05-Q06":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>光刻胶单体与反应性质</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.6.13 · 长郡中学 · 第6题 · P05-Q06</div><h1>光刻胶单体与反应性质</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：有机化学基础/合成有机高分子化合物/合成有机高分子的基本方法</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：通过共聚链节推断单体，并判断异构体及官能团反应。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/认识有机物/有机物的分类/有机官能团的性质及结构</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/认识有机物/有机物的结构特点/同分异构体书写</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/烃的衍生物/酚类</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/烃的衍生物/酯</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/烃的衍生物/羧酸</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：H~1  Li~7  C~12  O~16  S~32  Zn~65</p><p>6. 光刻胶是芯片制造的核心关键材料。某种光刻胶(ESCAP)由三种单体共聚而成，ESCAP在芯片表面曝光时发生如图所示反应。下列叙述正确的是</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:07d74a63403d36f52f39bcbc38d99d1c7753daabec576b16cd10d9f0227f815f:0;\" style=\"width:517.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>A. 合成ESCAP的其中一种单体为乙苯　B. Y分子的二氯代物共有3种结构</p><p>C. 1 mol X最多和<img src=\"chem-asset:3eb036e6aaf8b427faef421e67dcc642dc15b11205c61a20dd02d24232a32397:1;\" style=\"width:96.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">反应　D. ESCAP能使酸性高锰酸钾溶液褪色</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】D</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．ESCAP的结构片段显示，其链节包含苯环、酚羟基和酯基等结构。通过断键分析可知，合成ESCAP的三种单体分别为<img src=\"chem-asset:0d7be1edff838efa8a826bec82ad3253013e0b4e451fdf19f452add485d56fcc:2;\" style=\"width:39.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:634410294fc2ff8ca89364dc85f889b19cbae50f0594f974c9c29b0117fea2ea:3;\" style=\"width:42.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:75a16a9fa5590ed54094fb5666b2a53c3a3f48d009f5f349b801518114a80de4:4;\" style=\"width:59.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，A错误；</p><p>B．Y为异丁烯(<img src=\"chem-asset:1401074e6ab41a305f1024dd1a72e1b90ef615a003d55a41ef536187ed3c5fac:5;\" style=\"width:46.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">)，共2种氢原子，2个氯原子在同一个碳原子上时，二氯代物有2种结构，2个氯原子在不同碳原子上时，二氯代物考虑顺反异构有3种结构，则Y分子的二氯代物共有5种结构，B错误；</p><p>C．X的结构中含有酚羟基和羧基，羧基能与<img src=\"chem-asset:6a7ce9cf7b109051e41d0ac00529f4434a20a33f2ebd8ab10bc42dc66b2d790a:6;\" style=\"width:63.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">反应，酚羟基的酸性弱于碳酸，不能与<img src=\"chem-asset:6a7ce9cf7b109051e41d0ac00529f4434a20a33f2ebd8ab10bc42dc66b2d790a:6;\" style=\"width:63.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">反应，X是高分子，一条X高分子链上含有多个羧基，因此1 mol X含有的羧基远大于1 mol，故1 mol X最多可与远大于1 mol的NaHCO<sub>3</sub>反应，C错误；</p><p>D．ESCAP的结构中含有酚羟基，与苯环相连的碳原子上含有氢原子，易被酸性高锰酸钾溶液氧化，从而使溶液褪色，D正确；</p><p>故选D。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">本页保存原卷答案与解析。知识点标签和分类依据为本次整理结果；未逐题独立重解或校订原解析。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>精品解析：湖南长沙市长郡中学2026届高三下学期模拟卷二 化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><p class=\"source-path\">D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.6.13\\精品解析：湖南长沙市长郡中学2026届高三下学期模拟卷二 化学试题\\精品解析：湖南长沙市长郡中学2026届高三下学期模拟卷二 化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.6.13/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E9%95%BF%E9%83%A1%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%8C%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E9%95%BF%E9%83%A1%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%8C%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原 Word 文件</a></p><p class=\"muted\">原文定位：第6题。共享材料随整题保留，小问标签用于检索。</p></details></main></body></html>","assets":["07d74a63403d36f52f39bcbc38d99d1c7753daabec576b16cd10d9f0227f815f","0d7be1edff838efa8a826bec82ad3253013e0b4e451fdf19f452add485d56fcc","1401074e6ab41a305f1024dd1a72e1b90ef615a003d55a